# The live contributor allowlist is NOT on this branch — it lives on the `allowlist` branch:
#
#   https://github.com/whitecircle/halo/blob/allowlist/.github/APPROVED_CONTRIBUTORS
#
# It sits there, outside main's ruleset, so the approval workflows can maintain it with the
# workflow token: GitHub refuses the Actions app as a ruleset bypass actor by design, and this
# split keeps main's reviewed-PR rule exception-free. A maintainer approves a contributor by
# commenting `/approve @their-handle` on an accepted issue (.github/workflows/approve-contributor.yml);
# merged-PR authors are appended automatically (approve-merged-contributor.yml); pr-gate.yml reads
# the list from that branch via the API.
